 "text": "Departments | Scott County, IN\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nVA Temp Location\nVA Office temporary Location\nRead On...\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nDepartments\nGovernment\nResources\nServices\nHow Do I...\nSearch\nHome\nDepartments\nDepartments\n9\n1\n1\n2\nCourts\nLearn more about the courts serving Scott County.\neGov Training\nThe eGov Training Department provide training in MS Office, Web-based Applications, County Network and more.\nHighway Department\nObtain information about animal pickup, pot hole repair, culverts, ditch repair, brush cutting, dead tree cleanup, debris, trash, graffiti, and road signs.\nInformation Technologies\nLook through department contact information for Information Technologies.\nPlanning Department\nLearn about the Planning Department.\nSoil & Water Conservation District\nObtain information about the Soil & Water Conservation District.\nTransfer Station\nLearn about the Transfer Station in Scott County.\nVisitors Commission\nScott County offers our visitors the experience of unique and historical places among communities of welcoming and friendly people. Our commission identifies the artifacts and activities that authentically represent the stories and people of our past and present.\nQuick Links\nProperty Taxes\nGIS Maps\nEmployment\nView All Quick Links\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nCourts\nCircuit Court\nClerks Office\nCandidate Filing Summary\nChild Support\nElection Board\nMarriage License\nScott County Marriage Requirements\nTraffic Tickets\nCommunity Corrections\nCommunity Corrections Advisory Board\nProbation\nProsecutor's Office\nChild Support\nPublic Defender\nAsk a Question\nCriminal Case Expectations\nPublic Defender Board\nSuperior Court\neGov Training\nHighway Department\nInformation Technologies\nPlanning Department\nArea Plan Commission\nBoard of Zoning Appeals\nDrainage Board\nSoil & Water Conservation District\nTransfer Station\nTrans